[{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0026","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49177","title":"Linux Kernel Cavium 硬件随机数生成器驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Cavium 硬件随机数生成器（hwrng）驱动中存在空指针解引用漏洞，具体位于 drivers/char/hw_random/cavium-rng-vf.c 文件的第 182 行，函数在处理 pdev 指针时未进行有效性检查直接解引用。本地攻击者可通过特定操作触发该漏洞，导致系统崩溃引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核相关版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49177"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:00:54Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:17Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 5.17.2 及以上版本，或更新至包含提交 e6205ad58a7a（主线）或 e47b12f94151（稳定分支）的对应内核发行版：5.10.110+、5.15.33+ 或 5.16.19+。如无法立即升级，可执行 modprobe -r cavium-rng-vf 临时卸载该硬件随机数生成器驱动模块以规避风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e47b12f9415169eceda6770fcf45802e0c8d2a66","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e6205ad58a7ac194abfb33897585b38687d797fa","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f619ecf484fdb11d96af754b241cfa934df131f9/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49177.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49177.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49177.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49177","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49177.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-rrxc-83pc-mr58/GHSA-rrxc-83pc-mr58.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49177","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49177.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-58725.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c777ba0f-468f-444e-99fb-bf985259d6f8.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0026.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0025","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49173","title":"Linux 内核 FSI 驱动 SPI 数据轮询缺少超时处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 SPI FSI 驱动中的状态寄存器轮询循环缺少超时机制，当硬件进入异常状态时，数据搬移过程中的轮询操作会陷入无限循环，导致系统挂起。本地攻击者可通过触发 FSI 总线上的特定操作使硬件进入异常状态，从而引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49173"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:00:54Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:16Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 5.16.19 及以上版本（5.16.x 分支）或 5.17.2 及以上版本（5.17.x 分支），或 cherry-pick 补丁 commit 89b35e3f2851/d4982ceb137e/dac1438f347d 至当前内核源码并重新编译部署。若无法立即升级，可考虑卸载或屏蔽 spi-fsi 内核模块（modprobe -r spi-fsi）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/89b35e3f28514087d3f1e28e8f5634fbfd07c554","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d4982ceb137e6ecd2b466a6de639790a148cf19a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dac1438f347d3b8cf892105c94e254f29c5764de","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f619ecf484fdb11d96af754b241cfa934df131f9/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49173.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49173.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49173","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49173.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49173.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-p9hw-fm35-gg6p/GHSA-p9hw-fm35-gg6p.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49173.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49173","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1e173d9f-6963-43dc-8cee-578d5eeff549.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/801d8b48a1d2a622adc024df81d19c312b396882/2022/CVE-2022-49173.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0025.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0024","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0024.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49172","title":"Linux Kernel PARISC 非访问数据 TLB 缓存刷新漏洞","description":"Linux PA-RISC（parisc）架构内核中存在 TLB 缓存刷新缺陷。当页面不存在时，flush_user_dcache_range_asm 和 flush_user_icache_range_asm 函数中的 fdc 与 fic 指令会触发非访问数据 TLB 错误，导致缓存行无法被正确失效，进而可能引发内存损坏。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 parisc 架构实现，本地攻击者可利用此漏洞导致系统崩溃或敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。官方已通过使用 flush_cache_pages() 临时别名映射方式修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49172"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:00:54Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:16Z","remediation":"请升级 Linux 内核至 5.10.163、5.15.87、5.16.74 或更高版本（含对应 LTS 分支），该漏洞已在 `flush_cache_pages()` 使用临时别名映射修复非访问数据 TLB 缓存刷新的修复提交中合入。如无法立即升级内核，可禁用 parisc 架构上的 fdc/fdc 指令相关缓存优化功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b3d6adb3a49d82e4e557c5fc16f50c9ff731da5d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ddca4b82027e2a66333dd40fab21a4beff435c7e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f839e5f1cef36ce268950c387129b1bfefdaebc9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f619ecf484fdb11d96af754b241cfa934df131f9/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49172.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49172.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49172","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49172.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49172.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-fc9v-5389-h387/GHSA-fc9v-5389-h387.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49172.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49172","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--21271946-4298-4fae-bfe4-4f6eae360004.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-49172.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0024.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0023","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49168","title":"Linux kernel btrfs 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Btrfs 文件系统在修复（repair）机制中存在释放后使用漏洞。当提交修复 bio 失败时，submit 辅助函数已自动对 bio 调用 bio_endio() 进行清理，但代码随后再次尝试释放同一 bio，导致竞态条件下触发释放后使用及空指针解引用。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞造成系统崩溃或潜在权限提升，影响使用 Btrfs 文件系统的 Linux 内核版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49168"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:00:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:15Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 5.18 及以上版本，或更新至 5.10.248/5.15.184/5.16.19/5.17.2 及对应长期支持分支的更新版本。对于无法立即升级的系统，可通过内核 live patching 机制（如 kpatch、KernelCare）应用热补丁，临时避免触发 btrfs repair 路径以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7170875083254b51fcc5d67f96640977083f481e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8cbc3001a3264d998d6b6db3e23f935c158abd4d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d1cb11fb45ebbb1e7dfe5e9038b32ea72c184b14","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e76c78c48902dae6fa612749f59162bca0a79e0b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e7e1d15d2bd8c373cf621614ddd17971a2132713","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2022/CVE-2022-49168.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f619ecf484fdb11d96af754b241cfa934df131f9/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49168.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49168.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49168.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49168","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/637a4a03e5e4a888b83fa1f62d45bf4fe1e3aa82/2022/CVE-2022-49168.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-54fp-2qhf-47h6/GHSA-54fp-2qhf-47h6.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49168","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49168.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-59135.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0022","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49161","title":"Linux Kernel ASoC mediatek 驱动引用计数泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ASoC 子系统中联发科 MT8183 平台音频驱动在设备探测函数 `mt8183_da7219_max98357_dev_probe` 中存在引用计数泄漏漏洞。`of_parse_phandle()` 获取设备节点时会递增引用计数，但函数仅在正常路径中调用 `of_node_put()` 释放，错误路径未正确处理，导致内核对象引用计数泄漏。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞通过反复触发设备探测错误路径耗尽系统内存，造成拒绝服务（系统崩溃）。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核使用 ASoC MT8183 驱动的系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49161"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:00:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:14Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至 5.17.2 或更高版本（5.18+）。对于使用发行版内核的用户，请安装对应发行版提供的最新内核安全更新（如 Ubuntu 的 linux-image-generic、Debian 的 linux-image-amd64）。若无法升级内核，可手动 cherry-pick 提交 9b9f6227e8d0c7c46b6d9d7b8a5c4e0536049fcf 到受影响内核源码树中，重新编译部署。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/28a265a1ee11febeec5ea73a804f30dcec3181ca","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9b9f6227e8d0c7c46b6d9d7b8a5c4e0536049fcf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f619ecf484fdb11d96af754b241cfa934df131f9/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49161.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49161.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49161","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49161.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49161.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-jxg8-rc3f-gh94/GHSA-jxg8-rc3f-gh94.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49161","https://github.com/InfoSecREDD/CVE-Discord-Notify/blob/3f4b2b159624fda9a5cd9efcc2a46893068cd4db/seen_cves.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-49161.json","https://github.com/x-s-g/Vuln-Intro/blob/aa42031a1aaff880d1d582777ef18a1a29cbebc3/Vuln-Intro/Data_Crawling/nvd/linux_kernel_cve_ids.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0020","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49134","title":"Linux kernel mlxsw spectrum 驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Mellanox Spectrum 系列网卡驱动（mlxsw）在处理设备固件上报的事件时，未对 CPU 端口（本地端口 0）进行有效隔离。CPU 端口虽然存在，但其部分字段未像普通本地端口那样完成初始化，访问这些未初始化字段会导致空指针解引用（CWE-476），触发内核崩溃。该漏洞需要本地攻击者具备访问受影响设备固件交互能力，影响使用 Mellanox Spectrum 系列交换机芯片的 Linux 系统。已在 commit 63b08b1f6834 及后续通用补丁中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49134"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:00:50Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:10Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 5.17.3 或更高版本，或合入以下两个补丁提交：4cad27ba2e5a（主线）和 bcdfd615f83b（稳定分支）。如无法升级内核，在 Mellanox Spectrum 交换机上禁用固件事件中 CPU 端口（local port 0）的异常事件处理作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4cad27ba2e5a5843a7fab5aa30de2b8e8c3db3a8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bcdfd615f83b4bd04678109bf18022d1476e4bbf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49134.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49134.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49134.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49134","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49134.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-rxrv-jjf7-ph47/GHSA-rxrv-jjf7-ph47.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49134","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-58575.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49134.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fcb89513-e6e0-422f-9d72-37cd9ac4f635.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0020.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0019","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49133","title":"Linux AMD GPU amdkfd 驱动进程退出时 SVM 范围恢复工作死锁漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 amdgpu 驱动中的 KFD（Kernel Fusion Driver）子系统存在死锁漏洞。当进程退出时，`kfd_process_notifier_release` 刷新 `svm_range_restore_work` 工作队列，该队列尝试刷新 `deferred_list` 工作；若 `deferred_list` 中的 `mmput` 释放最后一个用户引用，将触发 `exit_mmap` → `notifier_release` 路径，形成循环等待导致死锁。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞触发内核崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 amdgpu 驱动，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49133"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:00:50Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:10Z","remediation":"升级至包含该补丁的 Linux 内核版本（如 5.18+ 或对应长期支持版本 5.15.39+、5.10.119+），该修复已合入主线内核 commit `drm/amdkfd: svm range restore work deadlock when process exit`。如无法立即升级内核，可暂时禁用 amdgpu 驱动中的 SVM（共享虚拟内存）功能模块，或限制受影响 GPU 设备的使用作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6225bb3a88d22594aacea2485dc28ca12d596721","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/858822905f4bf44100d63c5e22e263109976f7cb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a6be83086e91891081e0589e4b4645bf4643e897","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49133.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49133.yaml","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2022-49133.md","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49133","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49133.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-wg4q-grgr-4qgj/GHSA-wg4q-grgr-4qgj.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49133.html","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49133","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49133.md","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--726fd6fb-0ac3-4bf5-98f4-89e9532d758c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0019.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0018","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0018.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49125","title":"Linux 内核 drm/sprd 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM 子系统中 Spreadtrum 显示驱动的 sprd_drm_shutdown 函数存在空指针解引用漏洞。当驱动初始化失败或设备绑定异常时，dev_get_drvdata 返回空指针，而 drm_warn 宏会直接解引用该空指针进行日志记录，导致内核崩溃。此漏洞影响 Spreadtrum 平台设备，需要本地权限触发 shutdown 流程，可造成拒绝服务。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49125"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:00:49Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:09Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 5.17.3 或更高版本（如 5.18+），该漏洞已在提交 c3acc8db1bc2（5.17.x 稳定版）中修复。如无法立即升级，可通过 modprobe 黑名单禁用 sprd_drm 模块：echo 'blacklist sprd_drm' > /etc/modprobe.d/disable-sprd-drm.conf 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8668658aebb0a19d877d5a81c004baf716c4aaa6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c3acc8db1bc221604e2db9807f01d8a44b97a64d","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49125.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49125.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49125","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49125.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49125.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2022-49125-drmsprd-fix-potential-null-derefere-1771410053000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-3hq9-36qr-g9r9/GHSA-3hq9-36qr-g9r9.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49125","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f2ea71c23456d0bc766953e4ba2672b9cace7c4f/CVE-2022/CVE-2022-491xx/CVE-2022-49125.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2022-49125"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0018.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0017","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49124","title":"Linux Linux 内核快速字符串复制指令机器检查异常拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 x86 架构中的 MCE（Machine Check Exception）处理机制存在缺陷。Intel Skylake、Cascade Lake 和 Cooper Lake 代 CPU 的快速字符串拷贝指令（REP; MOVS*）存在勘误，当满足以下条件时可能触发罕见的内核恐慌：1）存在不可纠正的内存错误；2）错误位于页面的第一个缓存行；3）内核正在执行从该页前一页的 copy_page 操作。快速字符串拷贝指令会消耗目标区域后紧接着的缓存行中的不可纠正内存错误并触发 MCE，导致内核崩溃。本地攻击者可通过精心构造内存布局触发此漏洞，造成拒绝服务。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49124"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:00:49Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:09Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 5.17.3 或更高版本（5.18 及以上包含主线修复），该补丁在 MCE 处理程序中直接返回以规避快速字符串拷贝指令的勘误，并在触发后自动禁用受影响超线程的快速字符串拷贝。临时缓解措施可通过 `wrmsr -a 0x1a0 $((0x850089 ^ (1<<0)))` 清除 MSR_IA32_MISC_ENABLE 的 bit 0 以禁用快速字符串拷贝，但会导致全局性能下降，仅建议作为无法升级内核时的应急方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8ca97812c3c830573f965a07bbd84223e8c5f5bd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ba37c73be3d5632f6fb9fa20b250ce45560ca85d","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49124.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49124.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49124","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2022-49124.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49124.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-5ghh-886p-hpp6/GHSA-5ghh-886p-hpp6.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49124.html","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49124","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-68535.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-49124.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0016","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49123","title":"Linux kernel ath11k 驱动死锁拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 ath11k 无线驱动中存在死锁漏洞，由于 wmi_mgmt_tx_work 工作队列在加锁竞争条件下无法被调度执行，导致管理帧因无法在超时时间内完成刷新而持续积压。攻击者可通过发送大量管理帧触发该竞态条件，造成系统拒绝服务（如 Wi-Fi 连接断开、管理帧丢失），影响使用 ath11k 驱动的无线网卡设备。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49123"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:00:49Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:08Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 5.17.3 及以上版本（5.18+ 已含修复），或安装各发行版对应安全更新（如 Ubuntu 的 linux-image-5.17.3 内核包）。该补丁已反向移植至多个 LTS 稳定分支，执行 `git cherry-pick 261b07519518` 和 `33e723dc054e` 两个提交可手动修复源码。若无法立即升级，可通过热移除 ath11k 内核模块（`modprobe -r ath11k_pci`）临时缓解，但会禁用对应无线网卡功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/261b07519518bd14cb168b287b17e1d195f8d0c8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/33e723dc054edfc94da90eecca3b72cb424ce4a3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49123.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49123","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49123.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49123.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49123.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-26p5-hwvm-hf8m/GHSA-26p5-hwvm-hf8m.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49123","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49123.json","https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf-sbom/blob/1de902277f69e7858a13cc31e49a38c217d3a4bd/excluded_cves.yaml","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2022-49123"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0015","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49108","title":"Linux 内核 MediaTek 时钟驱动内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Mediatek 时钟驱动（clk: mediatek）在设备探测（probe）过程中存在内存泄漏漏洞。当 probe 函数在初始化时钟控制器时发生错误，未能正确释放已分配的内存资源，导致内核内存泄漏。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞通过反复触发设备探测操作消耗系统可用内存，引发拒绝服务（DoS）或潜在信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49108"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:00:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:06Z","remediation":"建议升级 Linux 内核至 5.16.20、5.17.3 或更高版本，这些版本已合入修复提交 c6a0b4133985。该漏洞是 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt8192.c 中 probe 失败分支未释放已分配内存导致的内存泄漏（CWE-401），本地低权限用户可通过反复加载驱动模块触发资源耗尽拒绝服务。如无法升级内核，可禁用 CONFIG_MTK_SCP_VPU 相关模块编译或通过 modprobe.blacklist=clk_mt8192 启动参数阻止加载受影响驱动。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/02742d1d5c95cff8b6e9379aae4ab12674f7265d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7a688c91d3fd54c53e7a9edd6052cdae98dd99d8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c6a0b413398588fc2d8b174a79ea715b66413fca","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49108.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49108.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49108.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49108","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49108.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2022-49108-clk-mediatek-fix-memory-leaks-on-pr-1771410004000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-hq83-r674-gjwh/GHSA-hq83-r674-gjwh.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2022-49108","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49108.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-49108.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0014","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49069","title":"Linux AMD Display 驱动 FPU 保护缺失导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 AMD GPU 显示驱动（drm/amd/display）的 dcn30_internal_validate_bw 函数缺少浮点运算单元（FPU）保护。当该函数调用 populate_dml_pipes 进行浮点运算时，若同时启用 DRM 调试日志，线程上下文切换可能导致 FPU 状态损坏，触发 general protection fault 内核崩溃。本地攻击者可运行 WebGL Aquarium 等图形密集型应用导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响启用 AMDGPU 驱动的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49069"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:00:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:16:59Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 5.16.20 / 5.17.3 / 5.18 及以上版本。对应提交为 e995c5d52ec7、76f4c5e5f99e、ca1198849ab0。若无法升级，可将 drm debug 日志级别降至 0x1f 以下作为临时缓解措施，避免在启用高等级调试日志时长时间运行 WebGL 等高负载图形应用触发 FPU 上下文切换异常。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/76f4c5e5f99ee7084b555d9a38e8ffeb16ec65a2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ca1198849ab0e7af5efb392ef6baf1138f6fc086","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e995c5d52ec7415644eee617fc7e906b51aec7ae","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49069.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49069","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49069.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49069.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49069.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49069.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-63x2-r5m2-h8pv/GHSA-63x2-r5m2-h8pv.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-49069","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ab3330a4-8041-4412-a6a6-f1d981284a40.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-49069.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0014.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0044","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0044.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49484","title":"Linux kernel mt76 mt7915 驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 MT76 无线驱动中的 mt7915 芯片驱动存在空指针解引用漏洞，当 mt7915_mac_fill_rx_vector 函数处理特定无线帧时未能正确检查指针有效性，在内存分配失败或异常条件下可导致空指针解引用，造成内核崩溃（拒绝服务）。攻击者通过发送特制的无线帧即可触发该漏洞，影响使用 MT7915 芯片的无线设备。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49484"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-02-26T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.15.59、5.19.11 或更高版本（该漏洞已在 5.15 和 5.19 稳定分支中修复），或合入 commit 42bdaadbfbcc 对应的补丁。如无法立即升级内核，可通过 modprobe.blacklist=mt7915e 内核参数临时禁用 mt7915 驱动模块以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49484.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49484.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49484.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49484","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49484.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-m2qv-9v9x-x3fp/GHSA-m2qv-9v9x-x3fp.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49484","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49484.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cf7262c2-3800-44e2-aa0e-a1d2442d69f8.json","https://github.com/begumsozer/Atelier_Data_Project/blob/c180b70b99084444dad46b49963b14f4cf496528/cve_ids.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0044.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0036","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0036.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49342","title":"Linux 内核 bgmac 以太网驱动引用计数泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 bgmac 以太网驱动中函数 bcma_mdio_mii_register 调用 of_get_child_by_name() 获取设备节点后未调用 of_node_put() 释放引用计数，导致引用计数泄漏。该函数每次被调用时都会递增设备节点的引用计数，缺少对应的释放操作使得引用计数持续增长。本地攻击者可通过反复加载卸载 bgmac 驱动模块耗尽系统内存资源，从而触发拒绝服务（DoS）条件。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 4.8 至 5.17.15 之前及 5.18 至 5.18.4 之前的版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49342"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2025-02-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.17.15、5.18.4 或 5.19 及以上版本，修复补丁已合入主线。涉及修复提交：b51996e35bbf、7fb1fe7d9a16、b8d91399775c。如无法立即升级，可卸载 bgmac 内核模块（rmmod bgmac）并禁用相关 Broadcom 以太网接口以缓解风险。生产环境建议订阅 LTS 内核稳定更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7fb1fe7d9a167205413f1de8db9f7d0f82c78286","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b51996e35bbfcc7a27d94dfeed5cc2429b2c0df4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b8d91399775c55162073bb2aca061ec42e3d4bc1","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2022-49342"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0036.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0032","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49303","title":"Linux 内核 r8188eu 驱动死锁漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 r8188eu 驱动中的 rtw_joinbss_event_prehandle 函数存在死锁漏洞。线程1持有 pmlmepriv->lock 锁后调用 del_timer_sync() 等待定时器停止，而定时器回调函数 rtw_join_timeout_handler 也需要获取同一把锁，导致相互等待形成死锁，系统无法响应。攻击者可利用此漏洞造成本地拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49303"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2025-02-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.18.4 或更高版本，该版本已将 del_timer_sync() 移出锁保护范围并改用 spin_lock_irq() 修复死锁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T11:58:30Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0fcddf9c7c10202946d5b19409efbdff744fba88","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/25cf414b0610fea29d8e045f315648d9007c9a46"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0032.toml"}]